{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4c53f973-ded3-84bc-ab2d-bf3b64f023b7",
  "created_at": "2026-01-11T12:04:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rachel Okafor",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:57:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:57:23-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. Yes. My name is Rachel Okafor. I know it's Sunday and City Hall is closed, so I was told this is the number to use after the storm. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:57:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, this line's up on weekends for storm stuff. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:57:50-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The storm drain on the corner is full. It's full to the top, and it is not draining at all. The water just sits in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:58:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And that's after the storm yesterday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:58:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The coastal storm, Friday and Saturday. It ended yesterday. This morning the drain is still full, and nothing is going down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:58:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Let me write that down. What's the address, or the nearest corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:58:32-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am at three, two, eight Pelham Street. The drain is on the corner right by my house. In the Historic Hill area."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:58:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three twenty-eight Pelham. Okay. Is it the drain on the street side, right at the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:58:56-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, at the curb. The grate is there, but you can barely see it. It is packed with leaves and, um, grit. Sand and little stones."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:59:11-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that happens a lot after a big blow. Is the water up in the road, or is it just sitting in the drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:59:25-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly in the drain and a little in the gutter. And the sidewalk is a sheet of mud and grit. It washed up over the curb. It is slippery to walk on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:59:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so mud and grit across the sidewalk. Anything getting into a house or a yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:59:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Not at my house. It is just the drain and the sidewalk right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:00:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That helps me sort it. So what are you hoping for, that someone comes and clears the drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:00:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I would like the drain cleaned, please. Cleared out so it can take water again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:00:24-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. I'm putting down, catch basin at the corner of Pelham, full, not draining, debris and sediment on the sidewalk. Is there a cross street you can see from there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:00:42-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look. [pause] I'm walking out to the front. It is Pelham and, um, I have to read the sign. [pause] It's a little hard to see with the sun."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:01:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No rush, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:01:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I do not want to give you the wrong one. Can you find it with just the house number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:01:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, three twenty-eight Pelham is plenty. The crew will find the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:01:24-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you. Someone from a few doors down is baking, I think. I can smell fresh bread drifting over. So at least the street smells nice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:01:40-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's something. Okay, so I'll log this for the next crew. I can't tell you exactly when, since they're hitting a lot of spots after the storm. But it goes on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:02:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Do you know if it will be today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:02:07-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be today, could be tomorrow. Crews do the worst ones first, like where water's backing into streets or homes. Yours is lower down, but it's on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:02:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. And what should I do about the sidewalk? Should I sweep it myself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:02:33-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you want to, sure. Just keep the debris out of the drain. Don't sweep it back in. Shovel it up and bag it, if you can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:02:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I will leave the drain alone and wait. Is it all right if I give you my phone number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:03:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, go ahead, in case the crew has a question."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:03:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is four, zero, one. [pause] Five, five, five. [pause] Zero, one, nine, nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:03:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-nine. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:03:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:03:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And it's Rachel Okafor, O-K-A-F-O-R?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:03:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. O, K, A, F, O, R. Good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:03:34-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So that's logged. If it gets worse, like water coming up into the road or toward a house, call back right away and tell them it's gotten worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:03:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you, Kevin. Will I get a call when it is done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:04:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not necessarily. They might just clear it and move on. But if there's a question, they'd use that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:04:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. That is fine. Thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:04:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Rachel. Have a good rest of your Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:04:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
